@startuml
' ============================================
' ooad-phase:   實作
' chapter:      12-1
' realizes:     UC-04, UC-05, UC-07, FR-07, FR-12～FR-17, FR-20
' source:       frontend/focus-flow/src/components/navigationConfig.js, pages/StudentDashboard.jsx, StudentCourses.jsx, StudentLineBot.jsx, StudentShortsWall.jsx（程式碼）
' verified:     2026-09-30
' status:       draft
' implemented:  yes
' ai-assisted:  yes / Claude Code / 依學生端側邊欄頁面、課程內容切換與彈窗程式繪製畫面移轉圖
' ============================================
!include ../_style.puml

title 學生端畫面移轉圖
hide empty description

state "總覽" as home
state "我的課程\n（課程清單）" as courses
state "課程內容\n（影片播放與 AI 問答）" as detail
state "詢問助教\nQR code 小卡" as tutor
state "LINE 提問" as line
state "解除綁定確認" as unbind
state "教學短片" as shorts
state "短片播放彈窗" as player

[*] -down-> home : 學生登入成功

home -down-> courses : 側邊欄「我的課程」\n或課程進度「查看全部」
home -down-> line : 側邊欄「LINE 提問」\n或按「前往 LINE 提問」
home -down-> shorts : 側邊欄「教學短片」

courses -down-> detail : 按「進入課程」
detail -up-> courses : 按返回
detail --> detail : 選擇影片、送出問題\n或點選來源片段\n/ 播放器跳至對應時間
detail -down-> tutor : 按「詢問助教」
tutor -up-> detail : 關閉小卡

line -down-> unbind : 按「解除 LINE 綁定」\n[已綁定]
unbind -up-> line : 確定解除或取消

shorts -down-> player : 點選短片卡片
player -up-> shorts : 按 Esc、關閉\n或點選背景

@enduml
